{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31766","headline":"题岸上人郡内闲居 · 贾岛","name":"题岸上人郡内闲居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"静向方寸求，不居山嶂幽。\n池开菡萏香，门闭莓苔秋。\n金玉重四句，粃糠轻九流。\n鑪烟上乔木，钟磬下危楼。\n手种一株松，贞心与师俦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31766.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31766","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}